====================================================================================================
binding (CONTEXT.md): S_eps=(4pi)^eps e^{-eps gE}
  [1/kT^2]-transform  A(eps)      = -L_b + epsilon*(-L_b**2/2 - pi**2/12) - 1/epsilon
  (1-x) coefficient   -eps*A      = L_b*epsilon + 1
  delta(1-x) coeff.   B(eps)      = -L_b**2/2 - L_b*l_zeta + epsilon*(-L_b**3/3 - L_b**2*l_zeta/2 - pi**2*L_b/6 - pi**2*l_zeta/12 - 2*zeta(3)/3) - pi**2/12 - l_zeta/epsilon + epsilon**(-2)
  poles: p(x)/eps coeff = -1 ; delta: 1/eps^2 coeff = 1 , 1/eps coeff = -l_zeta
  CHECK x-dependent pole = -p(x)/eps (PDF collinear pole)       : PASS
  UV counterterm  Z_F Z_2 - 1 = (alpha_s C_F/2pi) S_eps [ -1/eps^2 + (l_zeta - 3/2)/eps ]
  gamma_F = d lnZ/d ln mu =  a*(3 - 2*l_zeta)   (a = alpha_s C_F/2pi)
  CHECK gamma_F finite and = (alpha_s C_F/pi)(3/2 - l_zeta)       : PASS
  C~(1)_{q/q} = (alpha_s C_F/2pi){ [-L_b] p(x) + [1](1-x) + delta(1-x)[-L_b**2/2 - L_b*l_zeta - pi**2/12] }
  K~ = dln f/dln sqrt(zeta) = (alpha_s C_F/2pi) * -2*L_b  => K~ = -(alpha_s C_F/pi) L_b : PASS
  at mu=mu_b (L_b=0), zeta=mu_b^2 (l_zeta=0): delta(1-x) constant = -pi**2/12
====================================================================================================
Collins 2011 Sec.3.3.2: S_eps=(4pi)^eps/Gamma(1-eps)
  [1/kT^2]-transform  A(eps)      = -L_b + epsilon*(-L_b**2/2 - pi**2/6) - 1/epsilon
  (1-x) coefficient   -eps*A      = L_b*epsilon + 1
  delta(1-x) coeff.   B(eps)      = -L_b**2/2 - L_b*l_zeta + epsilon*(-L_b**3/3 - L_b**2*l_zeta/2 - pi**2*L_b/6 - pi**2*l_zeta/6 - zeta(3)/3) - l_zeta/epsilon + epsilon**(-2)
  poles: p(x)/eps coeff = -1 ; delta: 1/eps^2 coeff = 1 , 1/eps coeff = -l_zeta
  CHECK x-dependent pole = -p(x)/eps (PDF collinear pole)       : PASS
  UV counterterm  Z_F Z_2 - 1 = (alpha_s C_F/2pi) S_eps [ -1/eps^2 + (l_zeta - 3/2)/eps ]
  gamma_F = d lnZ/d ln mu =  a*(3 - 2*l_zeta)   (a = alpha_s C_F/2pi)
  CHECK gamma_F finite and = (alpha_s C_F/pi)(3/2 - l_zeta)       : PASS
  C~(1)_{q/q} = (alpha_s C_F/2pi){ [-L_b] p(x) + [1](1-x) + delta(1-x)[-L_b**2/2 - L_b*l_zeta] }
  K~ = dln f/dln sqrt(zeta) = (alpha_s C_F/2pi) * -2*L_b  => K~ = -(alpha_s C_F/pi) L_b : PASS
  at mu=mu_b (L_b=0), zeta=mu_b^2 (l_zeta=0): delta(1-x) constant = 0
